{"c":[{"name":"20261016T081625Z-8018844f464b5458","text":"Helper socket (fix/nonhost-nothing): a consumer without a valid hostProof is sent only status (helper/src/send-gate.ts); a test or script that reads proposals, memory or activity must prove the host key (test/socket-reader.ts authenticateHost, launch_secret.host_proof).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T101345Z-9f17fb785cbb46ba","text":"Page text controls send hasValue/rev, never value (zod refuses one); test pages build fields with helper/test/page-wire.ts onWire, and FakePage.write stands for Caret's write landing so pageRestore has the page-held before.","type":"note"}]}
